/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The React useCallback Hook returns a memoized callback function. This allows us to isolate resource intensive functions so that they will not automatically run on every render. The useCallback Hook only runs when one of its dependencies update. useCallback is a React Hook that lets you cache a function definition between re-renders.)
/E (The React useCallback Hook returns a memoized callback function. This allows us to isolate resource intensive functions so that they will not automatically run on every render. The useCallback Hook only runs when one of its dependencies update. useCallback is a React Hook that lets you cache a function definition between re-renders.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
